{"id":"npc:%E5%A4%AA%E5%90%88","profile":[{"title":"人物简介","text":"炎国肃政院副监察御史。在整合运动入侵龙门时与麟青砚、解真三人一同进入了龙门。在战斗中展现了较强的防御和战术评估能力。擅长土石法术，因私情作为护卫与司岁台秉烛人左乐一同现身于炎国尚蜀和玉门。在玉门帮助左乐调查山海众时在铸剑坊周围被睚重伤。","spoiler":true,"source":"主线剧情6-4 溃烂的疮疤、6-18 只有你知道等，活动剧情IW-2 无寻处等，惊蛰干员密录-司雷霆者。"}],"artCandidates":[{"kind":"avg","url":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a8/Avg_avg_npc_040.png","verified":true,"spoiler":true,"thumbnailUrl":"https://media.prts.wiki/thumb/a/a8/Avg_avg_npc_040.png/240px-Avg_avg_npc_040.png"},{"kind":"avg","url":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/22/Avg_avg_npc_299_1-1$1.png","verified":true,"spoiler":true,"thumbnailUrl":"https://media.prts.wiki/thumb/2/22/Avg_avg_npc_299_1-1$1.png/240px-Avg_avg_npc_299_1-1$1.png"}],"appearances":[{"story":"activities/act15side/level_act15side_02_beg","lineCount":15,"snippets":[{"commandIndex":479,"line":480,"speaker":"太合","text":"肃政院副监察御史，太合。"},{"commandIndex":556,"line":557,"speaker":"太合","text":"罗德岛一事，希望梁知府能给肃政院一个答案。"},{"commandIndex":557,"line":558,"speaker":"太合","text":"告辞。"}]},{"story":"activities/act15side/level_act15side_03_end","lineCount":27,"snippets":[{"commandIndex":320,"line":321,"speaker":"太合","text":"……理所当然。"},{"commandIndex":344,"line":345,"speaker":"太合","text":"你本答应左将军，酒盏抵达尚蜀后，便佯装遭劫，送与左公子。"},{"commandIndex":419,"line":420,"speaker":"太合","text":"梁先生保重身体。"}]},{"story":"activities/act15side/level_act15side_05_beg","lineCount":5,"snippets":[{"commandIndex":307,"line":308,"speaker":"太合","text":"以她身份而言，礼数周到，名副其实。"},{"commandIndex":317,"line":318,"speaker":"太合","text":"如今两方都如劲弓满弦，一触即发。"},{"commandIndex":319,"line":320,"speaker":"太合","text":"唯有在惹出更多口舌非议之前，了结事端。"}]},{"story":"activities/act15side/level_act15side_05_end","lineCount":4,"snippets":[{"commandIndex":375,"line":376,"speaker":"太合","text":"勿问。"},{"commandIndex":402,"line":403,"speaker":"太合","text":"十年前一次，二十五年前一次，再前一甲子，仍有数次。"},{"commandIndex":451,"line":452,"speaker":"太合","text":"公子。"}]},{"story":"activities/act15side/level_act15side_06_beg","lineCount":7,"snippets":[{"commandIndex":342